  "description": "Develops Hamiltonian flow, symplectic and volume preservation, variational wave equations, and Noether conservation identities. Compares midpoint, Verlet, and discrete multisymplectic action methods, distinguishing geometric invariants from exact energy or phase accuracy. A final moving-mesh section derives relative fluxes and the geometric conservation law.",
